    <string name="introduccion">Introduction</string>
    <string name="txt1">GoStay is committed to providing foreign tourists with an intuitive, efficient and satisfying accommodation booking experience in El Salvador. Our goal is to address the main challenges that visitors face when searching for accommodation in the country, optimizing the process through the use of innovative technology.</string>
    <string name="aspectos">Key Aspects for Tourists When Selecting a Hotel</string>
    <string name="txt2">Location: Proximity to tourist attractions and accessibility.</string>
    <string name="txt3">Quality and Comforts: Comfort standards, services offered and facilities.</string>
    <string name="txt4">Security: Guarantee safe and reliable environments.</string>
    <string name="txt5">Opinions and Recommendations: Reviews from other users and reputation of the establishment.</string>
    <string name="compromiso">GoStay Commitment</string>
    <string name="txt6">Quality Verification: Review and verify the quality of the hotels listed on our platform.</string>
    <string name="txt7">Transparency: Provide detailed and accurate information about each lodging option.</string>
    <string name="txt8">Customer Support: Offer ongoing support to ensure a positive experience from booking to stay.</string>
    <string name="conclu">Conclusion</string>
    <string name="txt10">GoStay is committed to continually improving the accommodation booking experience in El Salvador, using advanced technology to meet the needs and expectations of international tourists. Our policies are designed to ensure transparency, efficiency and convenience at every stage of the booking process.</string>
